{% set p2 %}{% t %}Affinity has no fixed deal, so a pushed pitch lands as a row on one of your own lists: the <strong>Organization</strong>, the people with a work email as <strong>Persons</strong>, and a <strong>Note</strong> on the company.{% endt %}{% endset %}
{% set p3 %}{% t %}The note holds the fit, the angle, the sources and a link back to the full pitch. Somebody already in your Affinity keeps the companies and addresses they had; a push adds, it never replaces.{% endt %}{% endset %}
